// THE PHOTON VIEW'S ISOLATION (PHOTON-VIEW-1; Types.h PhotonView Diffuse and
// Reflections) — the lighting text's own terms, one at a time, from the SAME
// shader text that lights every pixel: never a second shader.
//
// THE HOOK is custom_ps_posExecution, which upstream's template inserts inside
// main() after DefaultBodyPS (and HlmsAtom's decode template after the same
// body): the body is a PIECE, so pixelData — with envColourD and envColourS
// holding every environment source's final answer (the voxel cones, the
// irradiance field, the screen-probe gather, the SH ambient, the probes, the
// planar mirror, SSR and the ray-traced reflection, all composited into them by
// the lines above BRDF_EnvMap) — is still in scope. The picture's output is
// replaced by upstream's own BRDF_EnvMap evaluated again from a zero colour with
// the OTHER term zeroed:
//   value 1  Diffuse      envColourS zeroed: the indirect diffuse alone
//                          (envColourD x albedo x the diffuse lobe's albedo)
//   value 2  Reflections  envColourD zeroed: the specular environment alone
//                          (envColourS x the split-sum specular)
// Direct light, emission, refraction and fog are not in either picture.
//
// THE PROPERTY is jah_photon_view (its value is the mode), a PASS property set by
// FogHlmsListener::preparePassHash only while the view's photon listener has
// registered it — for the length of the one pass that shades the picture (the
// opaque pass) — so every other pass, and every scene whose view is not one of
// these two, generates the shader it generated before this file existed.
//
// THE HOOK IS SHARED: the fog's height layer defines it under hlms_fog and steps
// aside under this property (JahFog_piece_vs_piece_ps.any); the gather's and the
// card capture's definitions are prepass-only; HlmsAtom's is the hit decode's,
// whose pass never carries this property (atom_hit_mode is in the guard anyway).
//
// SPELLED OUT, NO DIRECTIVE MARK IN ANY COMMENT: the Hlms parser reads them there.
@property( jah_photon_view && ( hlms_normal || hlms_qtangent ) && !hlms_shadowcaster && !hlms_prepass && !hlms_render_depth_only && !atom_hit_mode )
@piece( custom_ps_posExecution )
	{
		// A SCOPE OF ITS OWN: BRDF_EnvMap declares its locals, and the body above
		// already declared them once in main's scope.
		midf3 finalColour = midf3_c( 0, 0, 0 );
		@property( needs_env_brdf )
			@property( jah_photon_view == 1 )
				pixelData.envColourS = midf3_c( 0, 0, 0 );
				@property( clear_coat )
					pixelData.clearCoatEnvColourS = midf3_c( 0, 0, 0 );
				@end
			@end
			@property( jah_photon_view == 2 )
				pixelData.envColourD = midf3_c( 0, 0, 0 );
			@end
			@insertpiece( BRDF_EnvMap )
		@end
		// The template's own output rule (Ogre-Next 4.0 always writes linear).
		@property( !hw_gamma_write )
			outPs_colour0.xyz = sqrt( finalColour );
		@else
			outPs_colour0.xyz = finalColour;
		@end
	}
@end
@end
